><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72007-72022"><rb>幾</rb><rt>いく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72022-72025">十</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72025-72043"><rb>年</rb><rt>ねん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72043-72046">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72046-72061"><rb>長</rb><rt>なが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72061-72064">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72064-72079"><rb>長</rb><rt>なが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72079-72082">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72082-72103"><rb>睡眠</rb><rt>ねむり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72103-72133">をつづけているものも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72133-72148"><rb>稀</rb><rt>まれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72148-72184">にはあるのでございます。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72184-72199"><rb>長</rb><rt>なが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72199-72214">いにせよ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72214-72229"><rb>又</rb><rt>また</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72229-72244"><rb>短</rb><rt>みじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72244-72262">かいにせよ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72262-72274"><rb>兎</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72274-72277">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72277-72292"><rb>角</rb><rt>かく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72292-72298">この</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72298-72325"><rb>無意識</rb><rt>むいしき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72325-72331">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72331-72343"><rb>眼</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72343-72358">をさました</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72358-72373"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72373-72379">が、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72379-72400"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72400-72409">たちの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72409-72430"><rb>世界</rb><rt>せかい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72430-72433">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72433-72457"><rb>生活</rb><rt>せいかつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72457-72460">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72460-72475"><rb>始</rb><rt>はじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72475-72487">まりで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72487-72508"><rb>舞台</rb><rt>ぶたい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72508-72560">がすっかりかわるのでございます。</seg></p>
