        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-112764-114008"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112767-112785"><rb>漸</rb><rt>ようや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112785-112788">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112788-112809"><rb>寝床</rb><rt>ねどこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112809-112812">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112812-112827"><rb>離</rb><rt>はな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112827-112836">れたと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112836-112851"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112851-112899">えば、モーすぐこのようなきびしい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112899-112926"><rb>修行</rb><rt>しゅぎょう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112926-112932">のお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112932-112956"><rb>催促</rb><rt>さいそく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112956-112968">で、その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112968-112983"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112983-112986">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112986-113007"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113007-113010">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113010-113034"><rb>随分</rb><rt>ずいぶん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113034-113049"><rb>辛</rb><rt>つら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113049-113067">いことだ、と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113067-113082"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113082-113103">いました。その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113103-113115"><rb>後</rb><rt>ご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113115-113127">こちらで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113127-113148"><rb>様子</rb><rt>ようす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113148-113151">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113151-113169"><rb>窺</rb><rt>うかが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-