        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-114008-114361"><seg source="#source-114008-114020">それは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-114020-114032"><rb>兎</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-114032-114035">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-114035-114050"><rb>角</rb><rt>かく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-114050-114056">も、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-114056-114077"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-114077-114080">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-114080-114104"><rb>神様</rb><rt>かみさま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-114104-114110">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-114110-114125"><rb>何</rb><rt>なに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-114125-114128">ぞ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-114128-114143"><rb>望</rb><rt>のぞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-114143-114158">みのものを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-114158-114170"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-114170-114176">えと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-114176-114188"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-114188-114212">われ、いろいろと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-114212-114230"><rb>考</rb><rt>かんが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-114230-114233">え</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-114233-114245"><rb>抜</rb><rt>ぬ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-114245-114251">いた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-114251-114266"><rb>末</rb><rt>すえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-114266-114278">にたった</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-114278-114293"><rb>一</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-114293-114302">つだけ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-114302-114329"><rb>註文</rb><rt>ちゅうもん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-114329-114332">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11