        <p source="#source-205339-205545">『まァ<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205348-205363"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205363-205372">という</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205372-205396"><rb>結構</rb><rt>けっこう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205396-205399">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205399-205417"><rb>所</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205417-205447">でございましょう！　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205447-205468"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-205468-205492">、こんなところで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-205492-205507"><rb>暮</rb><rt>くら</rt></ruby>しとうございます……。』</p>
