/rb><rt>あば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-243492-243519">れているもの……。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-243519-243534"><rb>初</rb><rt>はじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-243534-243549">めてそんな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-243549-243573"><rb>無気味</rb><rt>ぶきみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-243573-243576">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-243576-243600"><rb>光景</rb><rt>ありさま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-243600-243603">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-243603-243618"><rb>接</rb><rt>せつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-243618-243624">した</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-243624-243645"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-243645-243651">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-243651-243666"><rb>覚</rb><rt>おぼ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-243666-243690">えずびっくりして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-243690-243702"><rb>眼</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-243702-243705">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-243705-243717"><rb>開</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-243717-243723">けて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-243723-243738"><rb>叫</rb><rt>さけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-243738-243761">びました。――</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-243761-243975">『お<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-243767-243782"><rb>爺</rb><rt>じい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-243782-243797">さま、もう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-243797-243821"><rb>沢山</rb><rt>たくさん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-243821-243842">でございます。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-243842-243854"><rb>何</rb><rt>ど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-243854-243869">うぞもっと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-243869-243881"><rb>晴</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-243881-243893">れやかな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-243893-243911"><rb>所</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-243911-243917">へお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-243917-243929"><rb>連</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-243929-243932">れ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-243932-243947"><rb>下</rb><rt>くだ</rt></ruby>さいませ……。』</p>
