        <p source="#source-249142-251109">『さて』とお<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-249160-249175"><rb>爺</rb><rt>じい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-249175-249199">さんは、しばらく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-249199-249211"><rb>経</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-249211-249232">ってから、いと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-249232-249256"><rb>真面目</rb><rt>まじめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-249256-249259">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-249259-249283"><rb>面持</rb><rt>おももち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-249283-249286">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-249286-249301"><rb>語</rb><rt>かた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-249301-249304">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-249304-249316"><rb>出</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby>でました。『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-249334-249349"><rb>俺</rb><rt>わし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-249349-249352">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-249352-249373"><rb>役目</rb><rt>やくめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-249373-249388">はここまで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-249388-249403"><rb>汝</rb><rt>そち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-249403-249406">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-249406-249430"><rb>案内</rb><rt>あんない</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-249430-249448">すればそれで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-249448-249460"><rb>済</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-249460-249487">んだので、これから</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-249487-249499"><rb>先</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-249499-249505">きは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-249505-249520"><rb>汝</rb><rt>そち</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-249520-249541"><rb>一人</rb><rt>ひとり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-249541-249544">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-249544-249556"><rb>行</r