        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-260102-260797"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260105-260126"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260126-260150">はそこですっかり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260150-260162"><rb>身</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260162-260177">づくろいを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260177-260192"><rb>直</rb><rt>なお</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260192-260216">しました。むろん</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260216-260234"><rb>心</rb><rt>こころ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260234-260249">でただそう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260249-260264"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260264-260291">いさえすればそれで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260291-260306"><rb>宜</rb><rt>よろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260306-260336">しいので、そうすると</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260336-260351"><rb>今</rb><rt>いま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260351-260360">までの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260360-260396"><rb>旅装束</rb><rt>たびしょうぞく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260396-260405">がその</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260405-260417"><rb>場</rb><rt>ば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260417-260438">できちんとした</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260438-260462"><rb>謁見</rb><rt>おめみえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260462-260465">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260465-260489"><rb>服装</rb><rt>ふくそう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260489-260492">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260492-260507"><rb>変</rb><rt>かわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260507-260543">るのでございます。そんな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-260543-260558"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-260558-260594">でもできなければ、たッた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" sour