#source-271724-271739"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271739-271775">われませぬ。それでいて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271775-271790"><rb>奥</rb><rt>おく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271790-271793">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271793-271808"><rb>方</rb><rt>ほう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271808-271814">には</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271814-271829"><rb>凛</rb><rt>りん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271829-271841">とした、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271841-271856"><rb>大</rb><rt>たい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271856-271865">そうお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271865-271880"><rb>強</rb><rt>つよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271880-271895">いところも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271895-271910"><rb>自</rb><rt>おの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271910-271916">ずと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271916-271931"><rb>備</rb><rt>そな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271931-271972">わっているのでございます。</seg></p>
