        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-283315-283454"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-283318-283339"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-283339-283342">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-283342-283360"><rb>心</rb><rt>こころ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-283360-283363">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-283363-283378"><rb>底</rb><rt>そこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-283378-283381">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-283381-283396"><rb>固</rb><rt>かた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-283396-283405">くそう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-283405-283429"><rb>決心</rb><rt>けっしん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-283429-283454">したのでした。</seg></p>
