        <p source="#source-307419-307505">『あッ<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-307428-307446"><rb>矢張</rb><rt>やは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-307446-307449">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-307449-307464"><rb>元</rb><rt>もと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-307464-307467">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-307467-307488"><rb>良人</rb><rt>おっと</rt></ruby>だ……。』</p>
