      <div>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-351068-351796"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351071-351092"><rb>今度</rb><rt>こんど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351092-351095">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351095-351107"><rb>入</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351107-351110">れ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351110-351125"><rb>代</rb><rt>かわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351125-351134">って、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351134-351146"><rb>或</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351146-351149">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351149-351173"><rb>事情</rb><rt>じじょう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351173-351176">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351176-351188"><rb>為</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351188-351194">めに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351194-351215"><rb>自殺</rb><rt>じさつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351215-351218">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351218-351230"><rb>遂</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351230-351236">げた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351236-351257"><rb>一人</rb><rt>ひとり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351257-351260">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351260-351284"><rb>女性</rb><rt>にょせい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351284-351290">との</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351290-351314"><rb>会見</rb><rt>かいけん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351314-351320">のお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351320-351338"><rb>話</rb><rt>はなし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351338-351341">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351341-351356"><rb>致</rb><rt>いた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351356-351374">しましょう。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351374-351404"><rb>少々</rb><rt>しょうしょう</rt></ruby><r