        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-351796-352818"><seg source="#source-351796-351805">その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351805-351820"><rb>方</rb><rt>かた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351820-351823">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351823-351847"><rb>生前</rb><rt>せいぜん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351847-351868"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351868-351871">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351871-351886"><rb>大</rb><rt>たい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351886-351895">へんに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351895-351910"><rb>仲</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351910-351913">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351913-351925"><rb>良</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351925-351937">かったお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351937-351961"><rb>友達</rb><rt>ともだち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351961-351964">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351964-351985"><rb>一人</rb><rt>ひとり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351985-351991">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351991-352012"><rb>名前</rb><rt>なまえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-352012-352015">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-352015-352036"><rb>敦子</rb><rt>あつこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-352036-352048">……あの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-352048-352072"><rb>敦盛</rb><rt>あつもり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-352072-352075">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-352075-352090"><rb>敦</rb><rt>あつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-352090-352099">という</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-352099-352111"><rb>字</rb><rt>じ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-352111-352114">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-352114-352126"><rb>書</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg