        <p source="#source-469521-469697">『あれはモーすっかり<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-469551-469578"><rb>修行</rb><rt>しゅぎょう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-469578-469581">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-469581-469593"><rb>積</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-469593-469602">んで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-469602-469620"><rb>姿</rb><rt>すがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-469620-469623">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-469623-469635"><rb>棄</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-469635-469641">てた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-469641-469671"><rb>天狗達</rb><rt>てんぐたち</rt></ruby>でござる……。』</p>
