        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-482117-482806"><seg source="#source-482117-482147">あっさりとさばけた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-482147-482168"><rb>態度</rb><rt>たいど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-482168-482180">で、そう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-482180-482192"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-482192-482216">われましたので、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-482216-482237"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-482237-482240">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-482240-482255"><rb>方</rb><rt>ほう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-482255-482273">でもすっかり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-482273-482297"><rb>安心</rb><rt>あんしん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-482297-482306">して、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-482306-482321"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-482321-482324">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-482324-482339"><rb>浮</rb><rt>うか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-482339-482348">ぶまま</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-482348-482378"><rb>無遠慮</rb><rt>ぶえんりょ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-482378-482396">にいろいろな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-482396-482411"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-482411-482444">をおききしました、その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-482444-482459"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-482459-482462">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-482462-482486"><rb>問答</rb><rt>もんどう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-482486-482489">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-482489-482510"><rb>全部</rb><rt>ぜんぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-482510-482525">をここでお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-482525-482540"><rb>伝</rb><rt>つた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-482540-482549">えする</seg><ruby type="furig