        <p source="#source-503333-503848">答『その<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-503345-503360"><rb>通</rb><rt>とお</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-503360-503372">り……。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-503372-503387"><rb>神</rb><rt>かみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-503387-503390">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-503390-503405"><rb>祀</rb><rt>まつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-503405-503420">られている</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-503420-503444"><rb>以上</rb><rt>いじょう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-503444-503447">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-503447-503462"><rb>何</rb><rt>いず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-503462-503468">れも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-503468-503483"><rb>皆</rb><rt>みな</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-503483-503504"><rb>立派</rb><rt>りっぱ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-503504-503507">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-503507-503534"><rb>修行</rb><rt>しゅぎょう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-503534-503537">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-503537-503549"><rb>積</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-503549-503555">める</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-503555-503576"><rb>女神</rb><rt>めがみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-503576-503591">ばかりで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-503591-503609"><rb>土地</rb><rt>とち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-503609-503612">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-503612-503633"><rb>守護</rb><rt>しゅご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-503633-503651">もなされば、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-503651-503666"><rb>又</rb><rt>また</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-503666-503690"><rb>人間</rb><rt>にんげん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-503690-503693">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-503693-503720"><rb>願事</rb><rt>ねがいごと</