        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-540374-540925"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-540377-540395"><rb>不図</rb><rt>ふと</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-540395-540407"><rb>気</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-540407-540419">がついて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-540419-540431"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-540431-540440">ると、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-540440-540458"><rb>下方</rb><rt>した</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-540458-540461">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-540461-540476"><rb>流</rb><rt>なが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-540476-540482">るる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-540482-540506"><rb>渓流</rb><rt>たにがわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-540506-540509">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-540509-540530"><rb>上手</rb><rt>かみて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-540530-540536">は十</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-540536-540554"><rb>間</rb><rt>けん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-540554-540569"><rb>余</rb><rt>あま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-540569-540575">りの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-540575-540599"><rb>懸崕</rb><rt>けんがい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-540599-540611">になって</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-540611-540623"><rb>居</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-540623-540638">り、そこに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-540638-540653"><rb>巾</rb><rt>はば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-540653-540665">さが二三</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-540665-540683"><rb>間</rb><rt>けん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-540683-540695">ぐらいの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-540695-540710"><rb>大</rb><rt>おお</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-540710-540716">きな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#