g><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-555235-555250"><rb>例</rb><rt>れい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-555250-555253">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-555253-555289"><rb>白衣姿</rb><rt>びゃくいすがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-555289-555295">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-555295-555316"><rb>白木</rb><rt>しらき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-555316-555319">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-555319-555334"><rb>長</rb><rt>なが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-555334-555337">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-555337-555352"><rb>杖</rb><rt>つえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-555352-555388">をつきながら、ひょっくり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-555388-555409"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-555409-555412">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-555412-555427"><rb>傍</rb><rt>そば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-555427-555433">へお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-555433-555448"><rb>現</rb><rt>あら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-555448-555477">われになりました。</seg></p>
