>と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-686624-686648"><rb>人間</rb><rt>にんげん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-686648-686654">との</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-686654-686681"><rb>中間</rb><rt>ちゅうかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-686681-686684">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-686684-686696"><rb>立</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-686696-686705">ちてお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-686705-686726"><rb>取次</rb><rt>とりつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-686726-686732">ぎの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-686732-686753"><rb>役目</rb><rt>やくめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-686753-686774">をつとめるのが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-686774-686798"><rb>人霊</rb><rt>じんれい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-686798-686801">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-686801-686822"><rb>仕事</rb><rt>しごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-686822-686843">――。まあそれ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-686843-686861"><rb>位</rb><rt>くらい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-686861-686864">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-686864-686882"><rb>考</rb><rt>かんが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-686882-686888">えて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-686888-686906"><rb>戴</rb><rt>いただ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-686906-686915">けば、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-686915-686939"><rb>大体</rb><rt>だいたい</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-686939-686954"><rb>宜</rb><rt>よろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-686954-686966">しいかと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-686966-686981"><rb>存</rb><rt>ぞん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-686981-686993">じます。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-686993-687011"><rb>少</rb><rt>すくな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-687011-687020">くとも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-687020-687041"><r