        <p source="#source-692112-692408">『お<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-692118-692133"><rb>爺</rb><rt>じい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-692133-692142">さま、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-692142-692160"><rb>矢張</rb><rt>やは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-692160-692163">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-692163-692181"><rb>昔</rb><rt>むかし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-692181-692184">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-692184-692208"><rb>隠家</rb><rt>かくれが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-692208-692220">のあった</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-692220-692238"><rb>所</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-692238-692259">でございます。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-692259-692274"><rb>大</rb><rt>たい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-692274-692280">そう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-692280-692301"><rb>立派</rb><rt>りっぱ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-692301-692307">なお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-692307-692322"><rb>宮</rb><rt>みや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-692322-692328">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-692328-692349"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-692349-692355">には</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-692355-692379"><rb>勿体</rb><rt>もったい</rt></ruby>のうございます。』</p>
