        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-703657-703911"><seg source="#source-703657-703663">お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-703663-703678"><rb>爺</rb><rt>じい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-703678-703699">さんはいつもの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-703699-703714"><rb>通</rb><rt>とお</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-703714-703720">りの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-703720-703756"><rb>白衣姿</rb><rt>びゃくいすがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-703756-703759">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-703759-703789"><rb>藁草履</rb><rt>わらぞうり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-703789-703792">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-703792-703807"><rb>長</rb><rt>なが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-703807-703810">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-703810-703825"><rb>杖</rb><rt>つえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-703825-703828">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-703828-703840"><rb>突</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-703840-703846">いて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-703846-703870"><rb>先頭</rb><rt>せんとう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-703870-703873">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-703873-703885"><rb>立</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-703885-703911">たれたのでした。</seg></p>
