        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-704285-704839"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-704288-704306"><rb>内部</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-704306-704309">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-704309-704324"><rb>入</rb><rt>はい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-704324-704345">ってホッと一と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-704345-704360"><rb>息</rb><rt>いき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-704360-704366">つく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-704366-704378"><rb>間</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-704378-704390">もなく、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-704390-704408"><rb>忽</rb><rt>たちま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-704408-704411">ち</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-704411-704435"><rb>産土</rb><rt>うぶすな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-704435-704438">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-704438-704462"><rb>神様</rb><rt>かみさま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-704462-704465">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-704465-704492"><rb>御神姿</rb><rt>おすがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-704492-704507">がスーッと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-704507-704531"><rb>神壇</rb><rt>しんだん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-704531-704534">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-704534-704558"><rb>奥深</rb><rt>おくふか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-704558-704564">くお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-704564-704579"><rb>現</rb><rt>あら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-704579-704612">われになりました。その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-704612-704633"><rb>場所</rb><rt>ばしょ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-704633-704636">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-704636-704651"><rb>遠</rb><rt>とお</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-704651-704663">いようで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-704663-704678"><rb>近</rb><