        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-713237-713808"><seg source="#source-713237-713246">その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-713246-713261"><rb>折</rb><rt>おり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-713261-713264">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-713264-713285"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-713285-713303">としましては</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-713303-713330"><rb>感極</rb><rt>かんきわま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-713330-713336">りて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-713336-713357"><rb>言葉</rb><rt><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-713357-713420"><lem>ことば</lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-713405-713414">こかば</seg></rdg></app></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-713420-713423">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-713423-713435"><rb>出</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-713435-713450">でず、せき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-713450-713462"><rb>来</rb><rt><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-713462-713513"><lem>く</lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-713504-713507">て</seg></rdg></app></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-713513-713516">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-713516-713534"><rb>涙</rb><rt>なみだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-713534-713537">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-713537-713552"><rb>払</rb><rt>はら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-713552-713570">えもあえず、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-713570-713597"><rb>竜神</rb><rt>りゅうじん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-713597-713606">さま、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-713606-713630"><rb>氏神</rb><rt>うじがみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-713630-713645">さま、その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-713645-713660"><rb>外</rb><rt>ほか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-713660-713663">の</seg><ruby type="furigan