        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-730180-731271"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-730183-730198"><rb>夜</rb><rt>よる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-730198-730201">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-730201-730216"><rb>夜</rb><rt>よる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-730216-730222">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-730222-730237"><rb>又</rb><rt>また</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-730237-730261"><rb>神様</rb><rt>かみさま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-730261-730264">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-730264-730285"><rb>御礼</rb><rt>おれい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-730285-730288">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-730288-730312"><rb>申上</rb><rt>もうしあ</rt></ruby>げます。『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-730327-730348"><rb>今日</rb><rt>きょう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-730348-730351">一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-730351-730369"><rb>日</rb><rt>にち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-730369-730372">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-730372-730393"><rb>仕事</rb><rt>しごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-730393-730396">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-730396-730414"><rb>無事</rb><rt>ぶじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-730414-730417">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-730417-730432"><rb>勤</rb><rt>つと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-730432-730444">めさせて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-730444-730462"><rb>戴</rb><rt>いただ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-730462-730489">きまして、まことに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-730489-730513"><rb>難有</rb><rt>ありがと</rt></ruby>うございました……。』その<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-730552-730573"><rb>気持</rb><rt>きもち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-730573-730576">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-730576-730591"><