        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-731777-732156"><seg source="#source-731777-731786">ナニ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-731786-731819"><rb>参拝人</rb><rt>さんぱいにん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-731819-731822">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-731822-731840"><rb>話</rb><rt>はなし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-731840-731855">をいたせと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-731855-731867"><rb>仰</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-731867-731888">っしゃるか……</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-731888-731903"><rb>宜</rb><rt>よろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-731903-731927">しうございます。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-731927-731948"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-731948-731969">もそのつもりで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-731969-731981"><rb>居</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-731981-732020">りました。これからポツポツ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-732020-732035"><rb>想</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-732035-732038">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-732038-732050"><rb>出</rb><rt>だ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-732050-732062">してその</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-732062-732086"><rb>御話</rb><rt>おはなし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-732086-732095">をして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-732095-732107"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-732107-732119">ることに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-732119-732134"><rb>致</rb><rt>いた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-732134-732156">しましょう。</seg></p>
