        <p source="#source-754193-756484"><seg source="#source-754193-754196">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754196-754211"><rb>神</rb><rt>かみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754211-754220">さま、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754220-754232"><rb>何</rb><rt>ど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754232-754238">うぞ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754238-754259"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754259-754265">の一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754265-754286"><rb>生</rb><rt>しょう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754286-754289">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754289-754304"><rb>願</rb><rt>ねが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754304-754313">いをお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754313-754325"><rb>聴</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754325-754328">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754328-754343"><rb>届</rb><rt>とど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754343-754346">け</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754346-754361"><rb>下</rb><rt>くだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754361-754382">さいませ……。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754382-754403"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754403-754406">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754406-754439"><rb>女房奴</rb><rt>にょうぼうめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754439-754442">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754442-754469"><rb>入水</rb><rt>にゅうすい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754469-754478">すると</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754478-754493"><rb>申</rb><rt>もう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754493-754502">して、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754502-754523"><rb>家出</rb><rt>いえで</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754523-754538">をしたきり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754538-754562"><rb>皆目</rb><rt>かいもく</rt></ruby><r