        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-767856-769358"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-767859-767889"><rb>夫婦仲</rb><rt>ふうふなか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-767889-767892">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-767892-767907"><rb>至</rb><rt>いた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-767907-767913">って</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-767913-767937"><rb>円満</rb><rt>えんまん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-767937-767943">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-767943-767967"><rb>双方</rb><rt>そうほう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-767967-767970">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-767970-767994"><rb>親達</rb><rt>おやたち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-767994-767997">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-767997-768012"><rb>大</rb><rt>たい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-768012-768018">そう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-768018-768033"><rb>悦</rb><rt>よろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-768033-768060">こびました。これで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-768060-768072"><rb>間</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-768072-768081">もなく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-768081-768102"><rb>懐胎</rb><rt>みごも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-768102-768111">って、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-768111-768129"><rb>男</rb><rt>おとこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-768129-768132">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-768132-768144"><rb>児</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-768144-768150">でも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-768150-768165"><rb>生</rb><rt>うま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-768165-768177">れれば、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-768177-768192"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-768192-768261">のことはないのでございますが、そこがままならぬ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-768261-768282"><r