        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-780735-781285"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-780738-780750"><rb>斯</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-780750-780753">う</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-780753-780765"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-780765-780771">った</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-780771-780792"><rb>実話</rb><rt>じつわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-780792-780861">は、まだいくらでもございますが、そのおうわさは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-780861-780876"><rb>別</rb><rt>べつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-780876-780879">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-780879-780897"><rb>機会</rb><rt>おり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-780897-780900">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-780900-780915"><rb>譲</rb><rt>ゆづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-780915-780939">り、これからごく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-780939-780963"><rb>簡単</rb><rt>かんたん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-780963-780966">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-780966-780990"><rb>神々</rb><rt>かみがみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-780990-780996">のお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-780996-781020"><rb>受持</rb><rt>うけもち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-781020-781035">につきて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-781035-781056"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-781056-781059">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-781059-781074"><rb>存</rb><rt>ぞん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-781074-781080">じて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-781080-781092"><rb>居</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-781092-781107">るところを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-781107-781122"><rb>申</rb><rt>もう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-781122-781125">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-781125-781137"><rb>上</